  "description": "Test build of Orianna as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Orianna so the Ball flies from where it really is (on the ground, on an ally or on its way back) for Command: Attack and Command: Protect, Command: Protect goes to the ally in the most danger, and Command: Shockwave goes off for any enemy champion near the Ball (whether it would kill is still written to the log); with no enemy champion near she walks up to the lane minions and last-hits them instead of waiting by her tower. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
